  place() cannot run from 'paid', although the declaration allows it.
  Fix: Remove 'paid' from transitions.place, or relax the guard.

error transition-drift  Order.cancel()  src/order.ts:31
  cancel() can run from 'paid', 'placed', which the declaration does not allow.
  Fix: Add a guard that excludes 'paid', 'placed', or add them to transitions.cancel.

error terminal-state-leak  Order.annotate()  src/order.ts:36
  annotate() can run after status is 'cancelled'.
  Fix: Guard annotate() so it cannot run when status is 'cancelled', or list it in allowAfterTerminal if that is intended.

